# Route: guide 19 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Orc (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 35 to 38, 37
# quests, 4.5 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Desolace): Thunder Axe Fortress -> Kodo Graveyard -> Sargeron -> Kodo
# Graveyard -> Ranazjar Isle -> Kodo Graveyard -> Magram Village -> Kormek's
# Hut -> Kolkar Village -> Kodo Graveyard -> Magram Village -> Kolkar Village
# -> Sargeron -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Corrupter (1488; Lord Azrethoc
# 40); Khan Hratha (1381; Khan Hratha 42).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Blood of the Black Dragon Champion (6602), Vyletongue
# Corruption (7029), Legends of Maraudon (7044), Corruption of Earth and Seed
# (7064), The Pariah's Instructions (7067).

